irectory currently tries to create `.codeweb` inside the file and exposes an `ENOTDIR` stack trace. The MCP map tool forwards the same failure.\n\nValidate this case before CLI workspace creation and MCP queueing. Return an actionable containing-directory hint (CLI exit 2 / MCP tool error), while preserving file mapping with an explicit output directory, directory targets, and symlink behavior.\n\nCI also exposed that explicit-output file mapping depended on host ripgrep availability. The filesystem fallback now handles file roots directly, with absent-tool and failed-tool controls. Directory traversal remains unchanged.\n\nValidation: fourteen boundary tests include unchanged-fixture assertions and an MCP trace positive control proving no child starts for rejected input. Candidate package checks pass with and without the optional parser. Required local gates pass, including Node 22.23.2 and all five evals. Renewed independent review accepted the exact corrected candidate. All ten PR checks pass, including Ubuntu Node 22/24, Windows Node 22, no-optional-parser tests, the required gate, browser verification, structural checks and benchmarks. No version bump or publication is included.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-15T04:15:58Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T13:41:06Z","closed_at":"2026-09-15T13:41:06Z","merged_at":"2026-09-15T13:41:06Z","merge_commit_sha":"bee77bc4cb8e5e3c4d9e0a9e492473a0131fa101","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"GhostlyGawd:codex/first-use-file-target","ref":"codex/first-use-file-target","repo":{"id":1276062569,"node_id":"R_kgDOTA8raQ","name":"codeweb","full_name":"GhostlyGawd/codeweb","owner":{"login":"GhostlyGawd","id":141867403,"node_id":"U_kgDOCHS5iw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141867403?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GhostlyGawd","html_url":"https://github.com/GhostlyGawd","followers_url